ure. In 146 BC the Romans presented to Micipsa the captured library of Carthage". "We are told that the Romans even handed over to the Numidian kings libraries saved from the destruction of Carthage."<br>King Micipsa encouraged "learned Greeks to come to settle at Cirta."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1788, 'temperature': 0.2})
